          "description": "Tender Tales explore the everyday indignities, scenarios, and emotions that children experience. From a girl who gets a scrape, to friends who get into an argument, a boy who does not want to put on sunscreen, I hope that your child sees a piece of themselves—human, resilient, deserving of empathy and grace—in these stories.",
